00:01:33.336 --> 00:01:35.007
good leaders from becoming great,

00:01:35.007 --> 00:01:39.430
very good question, maybe
a great question from Josh.

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:41.473
I think there's a couple things.

00:01:41.473 --> 00:01:44.619
I think money, I think money is

00:01:44.619 --> 00:01:47.696
a funny way to hampen a leader.

00:01:47.696 --> 00:01:49.774
They're driven by that.

00:01:49.774 --> 00:01:52.351
I think that emotional skill sets,

00:01:52.351 --> 00:01:56.159
to be great at something
you have to over-index.

00:01:56.159 --> 00:01:57.877
You just have to.

00:01:57.877 --> 00:01:59.619
You have to be able to be great at it.

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:01.349
You can be a good basketball
player, you can be

00:02:01.349 --> 00:02:03.077
